    "summary": "Textile; rectangular length of narrow-strip cloth (kente cloth) made of rayon. Composed of five woven strips; pattern elements arranged in oblongs running vertically along each strip in combination of blue, red, yellow, green, black and white. Predominant patterns include: blue ground with vertical zigzags in yellow and red; narrow vertical bars alternating in red and yellow; green, yellow, black and red horizontal bands. Fringed at short ends with blue silk. Sections sewn together with blue thread.",
